---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PartnerImage from '@/components/PartnerImage.astro';
import { electdOfferSchema } from '@/lib/schema';
---

<BaseLayout title="Electd Platform — $149/month | Arkansas Campaign Data Cooperative" description="Arkansas campaigns on Electd: $149/month, no contract. Voter data, list building, canvassing, phone banking, email, SMS, voice, and direct mail." schemaExtra={[electdOfferSchema]}>
<section class="page-hero">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Electd</p>
        <p class="brand-lockup">Powered by <a class="brand-link" href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Electd</a></p>
        <h1 transition:name="page-title">Turn political data into action—for $149 a month.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">Electd is a political operating system built by grassroots organizers. Plan, organize, and execute from one platform—with no long-term contract.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/join/?intent=platform">Get platform access</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/pricing/">Outreach rates</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Visit Electd.io</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-product">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <nav class="page-toc" aria-label="On this page">
          <strong>On this page</strong>
          <ol>
            <li><a href="#subscription">Subscription</a></li>
            <li><a href="#how">How Electd works</a></li>
            <li><a href="#capabilities">Strategy to execution</a></li>
            <li><a href="#usage">Usage rates</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
        <figure class="product-figure">
          <PartnerImage variant="electd-preview" loading="eager" class="product-shot" />
          <figcaption>Product imagery from <a href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Electd</a>.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="subscription" class="section">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="partner-row">
          <PartnerImage class="partner-logo" variant="electd-mark" loading="lazy" />
          <div>
            <p class="price-label">Monthly subscription</p>
            <p class="price-amount" style="margin:0.15em 0 0.4em"><span>$149</span> per month</p>
            <p>No contract. Cancel anytime. Includes Electd campaign platform access.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h2 >What’s included</h2>
        <ul class="feature-list two-col">
          <li>Voter data access</li>
          <li>List building and targeting</li>
          <li>Canvassing tools</li>
          <li>Phone banking</li>
          <li>Direct mail tools</li>
          <li>Campaign CRM / contact tracking</li>
          <li>Volunteer management</li>
          <li>Campaign reporting and dashboards</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="data-path">
          <h3>Arkansas data layers</h3>
          <p>Start with SOS registration data plus campaign-provided contacts. Optional <a href="/data/">L2-enhanced</a> statewide data is funded separately through the <a href="/cooperative/">cooperative</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how" class="section section-platform">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 >How Electd works</h2>
        <p class="lead">From <a href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Electd</a>: every campaign action becomes intelligence—voter data, outreach, and activity in one system.</p>
        <div class="feature-blocks">
          <article>
            <h3>Know who to contact</h3>
            <p>Build voter lists with natural language or advanced targeting—without exporting spreadsheets.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Know what to do next</h3>
            <p>Surface high-impact actions from your goals, budget, and voter data.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Execute in one place</h3>
            <p>Email, texting, phone banking, canvassing, and direct mail—no tool-switching for basic outreach.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="pull-quote" style="border-top-color:var(--copper)">Data in. Strategy out. Execution included.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="capabilities" class="section">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 >From strategy to execution</h2>
        <p class="lead">Spend less time on spreadsheets and disconnected tools—more time talking to voters.</p>
        <div class="drill-grid">
          <article class="drill-card"><h3>Campaign IQ</h3><p>Strategy intelligence: what to prioritize, who to contact, where you stand.</p></article>
          <article class="drill-card"><h3>Live tracking</h3><p>Dashboards update so you know what’s working and where to focus next.</p></article>
          <article class="drill-card"><h3>Voter CRM</h3><p>Track supporters, undecideds, outreach history, and priorities in one workspace.</p></article>
          <article class="drill-card"><h3>Win path</h3><p>Race forecasting—see how turnout, messaging, and outreach shift the path to victory.</p></article>
          <article class="drill-card"><h3>All-in-one outreach</h3><p>Coordinate text, email, calls, and mail consistently.</p></article>
          <article class="drill-card"><h3>Ask Electd</h3><p>Prioritized prompts so teams execute instead of guessing.</p></article>
        </div>
        <div class="source-links">
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Full Electd site</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/managed/">Prefer managed sends?</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/how-it-works/">End-to-end path</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="usage" class="section section-foundation">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 >Outreach is usage-based</h2>
        <p class="lead">Quoted Electd rates for Arkansas cooperative participants:</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Email: <strong>$0.0144</strong> per verified email sent</li>
          <li>SMS: <strong>$0.025</strong> per verified text sent</li>
          <li>Voice: <strong>$0.04</strong> per minute after connection</li>
          <li>Direct mail: <strong>$0.70</strong> per mailer (print &amp; postage)</li>
        </ul>
        <p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/pricing/">Compare vs managed rates</a> <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/join/?intent=platform">Request access</a></p>
        <p class="attr-note">Platform product and imagery © <a href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Electd</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

</BaseLayout>

